; Units interpolated at a compound cost weigh at the compound's per-unit
; cost, which spreads its total over their absolute value, as beancount's
; convert_costspec_to_cost does: negative units leave twice the total as a
; residual, and 28-digit arithmetic can leave a residual of its own.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Euros
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock

2020-02-01 * "Negative units"
  Assets:Cash   100 USD
  Assets:Stock  HOOL {10 # 5 USD}

2020-02-02 * "A residual of the arithmetic"
  Assets:Euros  -83.33 EUR @ 1.2 USD
  Assets:Stock  HOOL {10 # 5 USD}

2020-02-03 * "Positive units balance"
  Assets:Cash   -105 USD
  Assets:Stock  HOOL {10 # 5 USD}
